<Layout title="About Wade Olcott" description="Meet Wade Olcott, founder of RevLytics: an experienced Revenue Operations leader who values straightforward communication, collaboration, and accountability."><section class="wrap page-hero"><p class="eyebrow">About Wade Olcott</p><h1>A small practice.<br/>A personal commitment.</h1></section><section class="section"><div class="wrap grid md:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] gap-12 md:gap-24 items-start"><Portrait/><div class="prose"><h2>Hi, I'm Wade.</h2><p>I spent more than 20 years building my career within businesses that are now part of Visa Inc., including senior leadership roles in global sales operations, analytics, and sales technology.</p><p>What I enjoy most is working inside a business: understanding the challenges, getting to know the people, and helping turn priorities into progress.</p><p>I started RevLytics because I enjoy being part of a team—working through challenges together, taking responsibility for important work, and helping people succeed. Rather than building a traditional consulting agency, I've chosen to work closely with one or two companies where I can make a meaningful contribution.</p><p>I value straightforward communication, good judgment, and accountability. I believe the best working relationships are built on trust, shared priorities, and a willingness to roll up your sleeves when something needs to get done.</p><a class="text-link" href="/how-i-work">How that translates into a partnership →</a></div></div></section><ContactCTA/></Layout>
